        <p>Plot° Tonge. THE CROWD AT THE WARRINGTON "A " v. ROCHDAI E HORNETS "A " MATCH. The original of the portrait marked with a X will receive the " Examiner " prize of ss. on calling at 'le affic.3 in BewsPy street on or before Saturday next, September 25th. Two prizes of ss. are offered to-day at the Wcrrington v. St. Helens match. Te'l your friends to buy " Examiner." One of last wc A's winners was E. Downs, 33, Fairfield-road, Stockton Heath. The other prize has "t bPen claimed.</p>
        <p>The following are the matches for to-day : Leeds v. Huddersfield. Batley v. Hunslet. Bramley v. Keighley. York v. Bradford. Oldham V. Halifax. Hull v. Dewsbury. Wakefield Trinity v. Hull Kingston Rovers Broughton Rangers v. Ebbw Vale. Wigan v. Salford. Swinton v. Rochdale Hornets. Barrow v. Widnes. Bunco-n v. Leigh. Warrington v. St. Helens.</p>
