        <p>THE LYON ROSE.</p>
        <p>This remarkable Rose cont:nues to create a great deal of interest, and rightly so, as it is one of the most lovely and distinct %arteties that have ever been intro- duced. As a pillar Rosa it will doubtless prove very valuable indeed, as it is of a vigorous, free-growing chlracter, and its handsome, pinkish yellow flowers are produced in abundance. In addition to their unique colour combination the blossoms are large, very fragrant and of exquisite shape.—" The Garden,"</p>
