        <head>BAFS MFG CUM IN A WEEK</head>
        <p>BAFS MFG CUM IN A WEEK</p>
        <p>Began as a Rash but Soon Thick CrUst Covered Tiny Boy's Head— People Said Child Would Never Get Over It—Treated by Several Doctors and Two Hospitals,</p>
