        <head>SOUTH POLE.</head>
        <p>THE SOUTH POLE.</p>
        <p>Captain R. F. Scott, who commanded the National Antarctic Expedition in 1901-04, is ganising an expedition to the South Pole. The expedition is to start next July, and Captain Scott, the story of whose voyage in ihe Discovery is still fresh in the public memory, hopes to outdo Lieutenant Shackle- ton and nail the Un'on Jack to the Pole.</p>
