        <p>A Bane of many Mothers Running Ulcers, that defied Doctors, Marvellously Cured. z: TO a "Norwich Mercury" reporter, Mrs. Reeve, of 32, pir,sR.REEVE, Alderson's Street, St. Catherine's Plain, Norwich, said: NORWICH. "My leg began to fester 18 years ago—l am now 71. I think the leg became weak through my standing for hours at the wash-tub and straining on tip-toe when hanging the clothes out. I used homely remedies and , ordinary ointments at first but I was soon obliged to go to the doctor. After trying everything he could think of, he told me there was no hope of saving the leg and I had better have it taken off at once. As I didn't want to lose my leg I Went to the Norfolk &amp; Norwich Hospital. Doctor after doctor treated me there for - three years, and then I was told that no doctor could cure me. "There were nine ulcers on my leg, which met and formed a huge running sore. A gentle. man hearing of my distressing case, gave one some Zam-Buk. Such a soothing feeling came over my leg, after the first dressing with Zam-Buk, and I slept as I had not done for 18 years. I persevered with Zam-Buk until I lost all pain, the proud flesh disappeared, and the leg healed up with solid FREE TEST Lesh, and had a nice new skin grown over all the old sores." As a curs for all forms of eczema, scalp disease, ringworm, piles, ulcers, pimples, Send this Coupon lies heal jumps, bad feet, cuts, bruisso and fastering wounds, Mors is nothing to equal and Id. stamp to 4' - ' - *.: • Leeds, for a free - sample. Warrinnton -247 SePt. 18th, 11,09 . _ , ..• - _ • •</p>
